sentences.t:
Sed neque currentem se nec cognoscit euntem
tollentemve manus saxumve immane moventem;
genua labant, gelidus concrevit frigore sanguis.

sentences.l:
But neither himself running nor does he know going,
or lifting his hands, or the rock immense moving;
his knees totter, cold has congealed with chill the blood.
